    "notes": [
      "Estimate for 6 servings using generic raw ground pork (about 21% fat) and ground chicken (about 8% fat). Leaner or fattier meat changes the result.",
      "Assumes 54 g dry breadcrumbs, whole milk, 40 g freshly grated Parmesan, 60 g parsley, 50 g shallots, and 3 g per garlic clove.",
      "Unmeasured sauce amounts use 2 tbsp olive oil total, one 8 oz can tomato sauce, 1 tbsp capers, and 1 tsp honey. One orange supplies about ¼ cup juice and 1 tbsp zest.",
      "Counts all cooking fat and sauce; small amounts of savory and spice blend are excluded."
